<title>UK: Eurotunnel names Rogez director.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel names Rogez director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-French channel tunnel operator Eurotunnel SA /Plc said on Friday it had appointed Pierre-Yves Rogez as director of purchasing.</p>
<p>Rogez joined the company at the start of February and, with a budget of 235 million stg, &quot;plays a strategic role in controlling the company's costs,&quot; Eurotunnel said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
